# Client material and raw renders. Both are kept on this machine but stay out
# of the repository: `docs/` holds the client's own remark sheets and
# screenshots, and the `saboloo *.webp` files are the untouched 3840px renders
# out of their archive. Neither is needed to build or run the site — every
# image the site links to is a derivative in `public/images/`, already
# committed. To regenerate those derivatives you need the renders back in
# `public/images/`; see the README.
docs/
public/images/saboloo*.webp

